{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Quick reflexes. Simple controls. Instant retries!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neon Strike is a fast-paced action-puzzler where you dash, bounce, and swap colors for survival. Get the color right, you're safe. Get it wrong... instant retry!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685030/extras/8f7673ca8f2018528ecee6613d5b99f4.poster.avif?t=1763581814\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685030/extras/8f7673ca8f2018528ecee6613d5b99f4.webm?t=1763581814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685030/extras/8f7673ca8f2018528ecee6613d5b99f4.mp4?t=1763581814\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls are super simple: one button to move, one to switch colors. Play with one hand on keyboard, mouse, or controller.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start as a sphere with one color and can absorb more by colliding with other spheres. But you can only store two colors at a time. Grab a third, and the oldest one gets replaced.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To pass anything that isn\u2019t a sphere, your active color must match. Get it wrong and you\u2019ll explode. Watch out for other traps too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There\u2019s more than one way to play:</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tactical Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to the goal! Bounce, stick, and aim your way through grid-based puzzles using smart angles and color swaps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685030/extras/2804ae427aa37b1f0ac02770d88a93bd.poster.avif?t=1763581814\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685030/extras/2804ae427aa37b1f0ac02770d88a93bd.webm?t=1763581814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685030/extras/2804ae427aa37b1f0ac02770d88a93bd.mp4?t=1763581814\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Infinite Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive as long as you can. Things only get faster, meaner, and more chaotic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685030/extras/32833988b5375d3dbc4d4a7fa4af5b3c.poster.avif?t=1763581814\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685030/extras/32833988b5375d3dbc4d4a7fa4af5b3c.webm?t=1763581814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685030/extras/32833988b5375d3dbc4d4a7fa4af5b3c.mp4?t=1763581814\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're in for a quick session or a challenge, Neon Strike keeps it simple, vibrant, and fun to retry.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"How to Play","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3685030/d90fc9305a4b8aa76fc6176838739081890ada14.jpg"},{"name":"Infinite Unlocked","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3685030/0c12f5c5674aa2c8232a703de6ce0fbfbab84ec8.jpg"},{"name":"2\u00d7Multiplier - Double Impact","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3685030/9799552c3ffda61ca17fba247677067a262bb5b1.jpg"},{"name":"3\u00d7Multiplier - Triple Charge","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3685030/675bb3e46f6a061ad61fcfc505ab2ce30d2c8434.jpg"},{"name":"4\u00d7Multiplier - Overdrive","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3685030/1c811b6e883f243ccdaa4614dde1cd342c3aa29d.jpg"},{"name":"Perfect Rebound","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3685030/f381a30a661fb9701d222839b1ca0f1e8ce08a45.jpg"},{"name":"Ricochet Doom","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3685030/230b8461225aa078d4d5b6890d0e105904a96025.jpg"},{"name":"One Minute More","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3685030/d9d733e4b6df0a9c1a2ef8749e70247a1ace681a.jpg"},{"name":"Endurance Test","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3685030/52485d96b752c75f676adb8643c9770322c0c0e2.jpg"},{"name":"Tenfold Focus","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3685030/2990d1bf5639078839dffda2f159e2860697fe2a.jpg"}],"total":22},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3685030?t=1763581814","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685030/4f92bbee557576e222715f2d8902b82d5dda5d1b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763581814","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685030/5ef5afb23f0b2f43b67c8d951f5d9b6dac7e14cd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763581814","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685030/5ef5afb23f0b2f43b67c8d951f5d9b6dac7e14cd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763581814","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3685080,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Quick reflexes. Simple controls. Instant retries!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neon Strike is a fast-paced action-puzzler where you dash, bounce, and swap colors for survival. Get the color right, you're safe. Get it wrong... instant retry!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685030/extras/8f7673ca8f2018528ecee6613d5b99f4.poster.avif?t=1763581814\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685030/extras/8f7673ca8f2018528ecee6613d5b99f4.webm?t=1763581814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685030/extras/8f7673ca8f2018528ecee6613d5b99f4.mp4?t=1763581814\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls are super simple: one button to move, one to switch colors. Play with one hand on keyboard, mouse, or controller.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start as a sphere with one color and can absorb more by colliding with other spheres. But you can only store two colors at a time. Grab a third, and the oldest one gets replaced.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To pass anything that isn\u2019t a sphere, your active color must match. Get it wrong and you\u2019ll explode. Watch out for other traps too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There\u2019s more than one way to play:</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tactical Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to the goal! Bounce, stick, and aim your way through grid-based puzzles using smart angles and color swaps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685030/extras/2804ae427aa37b1f0ac02770d88a93bd.poster.avif?t=1763581814\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685030/extras/2804ae427aa37b1f0ac02770d88a93bd.webm?t=1763581814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685030/extras/2804ae427aa37b1f0ac02770d88a93bd.mp4?t=1763581814\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Infinite Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive as long as you can. Things only get faster, meaner, and more chaotic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685030/extras/32833988b5375d3dbc4d4a7fa4af5b3c.poster.avif?t=1763581814\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685030/extras/32833988b5375d3dbc4d4a7fa4af5b3c.webm?t=1763581814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685030/extras/32833988b5375d3dbc4d4a7fa4af5b3c.mp4?t=1763581814\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're in for a quick session or a challenge, Neon Strike keeps it simple, vibrant, and fun to retry.</p>","developers":["Reza Mirzaei"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685030/c05a14e837e5ea4895803e32ac0f013ac14fea07/header.jpg?t=1763581814","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</stron